 "remarks": "An incredible opportunity to own a beautifully updated two-family home in the heart of New Canaan-perfect for those looking to enjoy the New Canaan lifestyle while benefiting from valuable rental income.  The spacious first-floor residence offers three bedrooms and has been thoughtfully updated for modern living, highlighted by a stunning, high-end renovated kitchen designed to be as beautiful as it is functional. Fresh, sophisticated finishes create a move-in-ready home with the space and comfort today's buyers are looking for.  Upstairs, the second-floor apartment has been completely renovated from top to bottom, offering a fresh, modern living environment with all-new windows, new appliances, a beautifully renovated bathroom, and its own separate washer and dryer. Stylish finishes and thoughtful updates make this an exceptionally appealing rental.  Whether you choose to live in one residence and offset your monthly expenses with income from the other, accommodate extended family, or add a desirable New Canaan property to your investment portfolio, 16 Raymond Street offers flexibility, income potential, and long-term value in one of Fairfield County's most sought-after communities.  A rare opportunity to combine the benefits of homeownership, rental income, and the New Canaan lifestyle-all under one roof.",
